  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Its main goal is to create sustainable and concrete solutions for the management of research data throughout its entire lifecycle.\n\nThis involves the following aspects:\n\nBesides effective technical solutions, standards for best practices are also developed.\n\nFrom ETH Zurich, the Digital Curation at ETH Zurich and the Department ID Scientific IT Services are involved in the project. Further information and partners are available on the swissuniversities website and on the blog Innovation@ETH-Bibliothek ."
    }
